+- [PROFESSIONAL-A-Z-CHECKLIST.md:133](PROFESSIONAL-A-Z-CHECKLIST.md#L133) — **C-05 Coordinate systems and origins** — Local and project origins transform without drift. State: gap (assessed 2026-09-10). A single global millimetre space with level elevations is implemented. There is no user coordinate system, origin relocation or rotated working plane, so the row cannot be assessed.
+- [PROFESSIONAL-A-Z-CHECKLIST.md:134](PROFESSIONAL-A-Z-CHECKLIST.md#L134) — **C-06 Layers and visibility** — Hidden, locked and isolated layers retain correct entity membership. State: gap (assessed 2026-09-10). No CAD drafting layer exists. The model field named layers is a wall assembly material layer, not a visibility or lock container, and DXF export synthesises layer names from levels. Recorded explicitly because the field name invites a false positive.
