 ### P — Procurement, products and pricing research
 
 Benchmark references: [Firecrawl v2 search API](https://docs.firecrawl.dev/api-reference/endpoint/search), [RIB CostX](https://www.rib-software.com/en/rib-costx), [Procore Project Management](https://www.procore.com/project-management). These references inform the category; each acceptance requirement is X-Ray's own target.
 
-- [ ] **P-01 User-initiated Firecrawl search** — Explicit query returns bounded real source links or honest failure. State: dependency-blocked (live credential); bounded contract implemented in development 2026-09-08: fixed v2 search endpoint, web sources only, at most 5 links, one click starts one attempt, honest typed failures (503 not-configured proven live in the browser; 401/402/429/timeout/cancel/invalid-response/too-large/busy proven with mocked fetch, 27 tests). No live Firecrawl request was made. Code/proof: [SC-04 pricing research](proof/growth/2026-09-08-az3-pricing-research/README.md). Remaining: real credentialed search with recorded usage, native transport.
-- [ ] **P-02 Supplier and regional filters** — Results show selected country, supplier and search timestamp. State: partial. Country, include-only supplier domain and finish timestamp are carried in the result contract and display summary (unit-tested 2026-09-08); no live result has been rendered. Code/proof: [SC-04 pricing research](proof/growth/2026-09-08-az3-pricing-research/README.md). Remaining: live result, location filter in the UI.
-- [ ] **P-03 Structured product extraction** — SKU, specification, price basis and source excerpt are reviewable. State: dependency-blocked (assessed 2026-09-10). Structured product extraction requires a live search credential that is not configured. The bounded contract returns web sources with a truthful not-configured state, and no scrape or extraction path is implemented (`src/lib/pricingResearch.server.ts`). A Perplexity route was verified live but is not wired into the product.
-- [ ] **P-04 Variant and product matching** — Different grade/size/finish cannot silently substitute requested item. State: gap (assessed 2026-09-10). There is no product or variant matching, so grade, size and finish substitution cannot be prevented.
-- [ ] **P-05 Price basis and availability** — Ex-tax/inc-tax, pack size, stock and delivery conditions remain explicit. State: partial (assessed 2026-09-10). Price basis is explicit where rates exist: tax basis, tax percentage, currency, decimals, effective date and supplier are recorded per price book and never inferred (`src/studio/priceBooks.ts`). Remaining: pack size, stock and delivery conditions are not modelled, and no researched price carries a basis because research cannot run.
-- [ ] **P-06 Missing and quoted-only prices** — Unknown price remains unknown instead of zero or invented value. State: partial (assessed 2026-09-10). An unknown price stays unknown rather than becoming zero: the quantity bridge reports an explicit unavailable pricing status per line instead of substituting a value (`src/studio/crmBridge.ts`). Remaining: there is no quoted-only state distinct from unavailable.
-- [ ] **P-07 Price freshness and provenance** — Each rate retains retrieval time, source URL and quoted currency. State: partial (assessed 2026-09-10). The research contract carries a finish timestamp, the selected country and supplier filters, and duplicate links are collapsed, so a returned rate would keep its retrieval context (`src/lib/pricingResearch.server.ts`, `src/studio/pricing/pricingResearch.ts`). Remaining: no live retrieval has occurred, so no rate carries real provenance yet.
-- [ ] **P-08 Review before rate application** — Unreviewed research never changes project costs. State: partial (assessed 2026-09-10). Unreviewed research cannot change project cost because research results are never applied to rates at all: the panel presents candidates and the application path does not exist (`src/studio/pricing/PricingResearchPanel.tsx`). Remaining: this is currently satisfied by absence rather than by a working review gate, so it must be re-assessed when application is built.
-- [ ] **P-09 Provider budgets and credentials** — Secrets remain server/native-only and requests respect limits. State: partial. Key read only from server FIRECRAWL_API_KEY with an operator enable flag; never in responses, failures or browser code (tested 2026-09-08); 64 KiB request, 35 s and 1 MiB response caps; single in-flight search; no automatic retry; nominal credit estimate shown separately from reported usage. Code/proof: [SC-04 pricing research](proof/growth/2026-09-08-az3-pricing-research/README.md). Remaining: durable budget reservation/reconciliation, tenant authorization, native credential store.
-- [ ] **P-10 Search cancellation and retry** — Cancel stops application; rate limits retain existing data. State: partial. Cancel aborts the request and discards late responses; 429 maps to a retryable rate-limited failure; a seeded price book (1 book, 2 rows) stayed byte-identical across a failed search in the browser (2026-09-08); retry requires a fresh click. Code/proof: [SC-04 pricing research](proof/growth/2026-09-08-az3-pricing-research/README.md). Remaining: live provider behaviour, cancel proven against a real in-flight request.
-- [ ] **P-11 RFQ preparation and comparisons** — Supplier offers compare matched scope and exclusions. State: gap (assessed 2026-09-10). Request-for-quotation preparation and offer comparison are not implemented.
-- [ ] **P-12 Purchase orders and approvals** — Only approved quantities/rates enter issued orders. State: gap (assessed 2026-09-10). Purchase orders and approvals are not implemented.
-- [ ] **P-13 Lead times, alternates and substitutions** — Approved alternative retains original specification and decision. State: gap (assessed 2026-09-10). Lead times, alternates and substitutions are not implemented.
-- [ ] **P-14 Receiving, returns and reconciliation** — Ordered, delivered, returned and invoiced quantities reconcile. State: gap (assessed 2026-09-10). Receiving, returns and invoice reconciliation are not implemented.
