6-09-08-07-walkthrough-release/index.html). Latest bounded milestone: [Stage09 clean plans, boundaries, body reach and release evidence](proof/growth/2026-09-08-09-walkthrough-polish/index.html); full row stays open.</small></div><span class="state">partial</span></article><article class="requirement" data-search="r-03 section boxes and clipping clipped geometry and caps reveal intended interior sections"><div class="reqid"><span class="check" aria-label="Unchecked"></span>R-03</div><div><strong>Section boxes and clipping</strong><p class="acceptance">Pass when: Clipped geometry and caps reveal intended interior sections.</p><small class="muted">State: gap (assessed 2026-09-10). Section cutting produces real plan and section output in the drawing pipeline, but there is no interactive 3D section box or clipping with caps in the viewer, which is what this row requires.</small></div><span class="state">gap</span></article><article class="requirement" data-search="r-04 visibility by discipline and phase saved views reproduce selected object sets"><div class="reqid"><span class="check" aria-label="Unchecked"></span>R-04</div><div><strong>Visibility by discipline and phase</strong><p class="acceptance">Pass when: Saved views reproduce selected object sets.</p><small class="muted">State: partial (assessed 2026-09-10). Saved views restore camera and display state, and the model viewer separates source reconstructions from a designed model with an explicit status (`src/studio/architect/designedScene.ts`, SC-21). Remaining: there is no visibility control by discipline or phase, so a saved view cannot reproduce a selected object set.</small></div><span class="state">partial</span></article><article class="requirement" data-search="r-05 source-linked 3d inspection picked object opens matching source evidence and assumptions"><div class="reqid"><span class="check" aria-label="Unchecked"></span>R-05</div><div><strong>Source-linked 3D inspection</strong><p class="acceptance">Pass 