-"I-13","Interoperability, imports and integrations","Import preview and cancellation","Invalid/cancelled import leaves current project unchanged","partial","src/cad.rs","","ACAD; DWG; BCF; IDS","no","State: partial (assessed 2026-09-10). A cancelled or invalid import leaves the project unchanged: the CAD bridge supports cancellation tokens, a malformed workbook preserves prior state, and an edited DXF refuses to restore a stale embedded design rather than partially applying it (`src-tauri/src/cad.rs`, `priceWorkbook.ts`, `exchange.ts`). Remaining: there is no import preview step before commit for every format."
