+"B-13","Backups, saving and project lifecycle","Storage failure recovery","Full disk/quota error preserves previous data and supports retry","partial","","proof/growth/2026-09-08-az3-protected-saves/README.md","FORMA; ACONEX","no","State: partial. Main project record verified in development 2026-09-08: quota throw and silent-write failures keep the previously stored bytes byte-identical and the in-memory edit; an explicit retry persists it (store test plus tablet 1024x768 Fast CDP proof). Code/proof: [SC-02 protected saves](proof/growth/2026-09-08-az3-protected-saves/README.md). Remaining: IndexedDB originals/materials and per-module records, production/native build. [section 04]"
