+"C-01","CAD precision and drawing tools","Lines, polylines, arcs and circles","Exact coordinates survive save and CAD exchange","partial","src/studio/architect/model.ts","","ACAD","no","State: partial (assessed 2026-09-10). Lines, arcs and circles are authored entities and survive a hash-bound DXF round trip that restores stable IDs exactly (`src/studio/architect/model.ts`, `exchange.ts`; `architect.test.ts` ""DXF parametric round trip preserves stable IDs""). A general open polyline entity does not exist: an imported LWPOLYLINE is exploded into separate lines. Remaining: a polyline entity, and coordinate survival through DWG and IFC rather than DXF alone. [section 02]"
