+"C-06","CAD precision and drawing tools","Layers and visibility","Hidden, locked and isolated layers retain correct entity membership","gap","","","ACAD","no","State: gap (assessed 2026-09-10). No CAD drafting layer exists. The model field named layers is a wall assembly material layer, not a visibility or lock container, and DXF export synthesises layer names from levels. Recorded explicitly because the field name invites a false positive. [section 02]"
